<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="1073065910"/></metadata></head><body dur="4:28.840"><div begin="26.189" end="50.944" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="26.189" end="31.350" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="26.189" end="26.764">不要</span><span begin="26.764" end="27.026">再</span><span begin="27.026" end="27.546">想</span><span begin="27.546" end="28.390">你</span> <span begin="29.567" end="30.093">不要</span><span begin="30.093" end="30.375">再</span><span begin="30.375" end="31.350">爱你</span></p><p begin="31.541" end="37.856" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="31.541" end="32.146">让时</span><span begin="32.146" end="32.701">间</span><span begin="32.701" end="32.999">悄</span><span begin="32.999" end="33.522">悄</span><span begin="33.522" end="33.797">地</span><span begin="33.797" end="34.712">飞逝</span> <span begin="34.931" end="35.476">抹去</span><span begin="35.476" end="36.499">我俩</span><span begin="36.499" end="37.192">的回</span><span begin="37.192" end="37.856">忆</span></p><p begin="38.310" end="44.501" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.310" end="38.857">对于</span><span begin="38.857" end="39.404">你</span><span begin="39.404" end="39.947">的</span><span begin="39.947" end="41.168">名字</span> <span begin="41.354" end="42.191">从今</span><span begin="42.191" end="43.203">不会</span><span begin="43.254" end="43.883">再提</span><span begin="43.883" end="44.501">起</span></p><p begin="44.743" end="50.944" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.743" end="45.478">不再让</span><span begin="45.478" end="46.005">悲</span><span begin="46.005" end="47.272">伤</span> <span begin="48.029" end="48.881">将我心</span><span begin="48.881" end="49.462">占</span><span begin="49.462" end="50.944">据</span></p></div><div begin="53.146" end="1:18.185" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="53.146" end="58.380" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="53.146" end="53.880">让它随</span><span begin="53.880" end="54.614">风</span><span begin="54.614" end="55.348">去</span> <span begin